    <p>
      <b>Algorithms</b>
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Algebraic block. Requires input 1.</li>
      <li>interval is converted to abs(interval); values below 1e-12 are replaced by 1.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <b>Equation or Rule</b>
    </p>
    <latex>y = interval\,\operatorname{round}\left(\frac{u}{interval}\right)</latex>
